{"chapter": "sites", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "00W1", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\v C", "FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "GROUPCLOSE_0001": "}", "GROUPOPEN_0001": "{", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{J}_U$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{J}_U$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\Ob(\\mathcal{J}_U)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\{\\text{id}_U\\}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{U} \\mapsto H^0(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{J}_U$", "MATH_0010": "$$\n\\mathcal{F}^{+}(U)\n=\n\\colim_{\\mathcal{J}_U^{opp}}\nH^0(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F})\n$$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{F}^{+}(U)$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0013": "$U$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{F}^{+}(U)$", "MATH_0015": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0016": "$V \\to U$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0018": "$U_i \\times_U V$", "MATH_0019": "$$\n\\mathcal{J}_U\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{J}_V, \\quad\n\\{U_i \\to U\\}\n\\longmapsto\n\\{U_i \\times_U V \\to V\\}.\n$$", "MATH_0020": "$\\{U_i \\times_U V \\to V\\} \\to \\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0021": "$H^0(\\{U_i \\to U\\}, \\mathcal{F}) \\to\nH^0(\\{U_i \\times_U V \\to V\\}, \\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0022": "$H^0(-, \\mathcal{F}) : \\mathcal{J}_U^{opp} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0023": "$\\mathcal{J}_U^{opp} \\to \\mathcal{J}_V^{opp}\n\\xrightarrow{H^0(-, \\mathcal{F})} \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0024": "$\\mathcal{F}^+(U) \\to \\mathcal{F}^+(V)$", "MATH_0025": "$\\mathcal{F}^+(U)$", "MATH_0026": "$s = (s_i) \\in H^0(\\{U_i \\to U\\}, \\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0027": "$(s_i|_{V \\times_U U_i})\n\\in H^0(\\{U_i \\times_U V \\to V\\}, \\mathcal{F})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-section-limits}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3023dd3826e012dd910e9b75e4a27931eb0d2d0441ed4a180cf1a7a3d7836881", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:71730220eb1d52ba696bee3e599d19d48d9852acd2465f4b3000db58a7e02b54", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be the category of all coverings of <MATH_0002>.\nIn other words, the objects of <MATH_0003> are the coverings\nof <MATH_0004> in <MATH_0005>, and the morphisms are the refinements.\nBy our conventions on sites this is indeed a category, i.e.,\nthe collection of objects and morphisms forms a set.\nNote that <MATH_0006> is not empty since\n<MATH_0007> is an object of it. According to the remarks\nabove the construction <MATH_0008>\nis a contravariant functor on <MATH_0009>.\nWe define\n<MATH_0010>\nSee Categories, Section <REF_0001> for\na discussion of limits and colimits. We point out that later\nwe will see that <MATH_0011> is the zeroth <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech\ncohomology of <MATH_0012> over <MATH_0013>.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nBefore we say more about the structure of the colimit, we turn\nthe collection of sets\n<MATH_0014>, <MATH_0015>\ninto a presheaf. Namely, let <MATH_0016> be a morphism of <MATH_0017>.\nBy the axioms of a site there is a functor<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>This construction\nactually involves a choice of the fibre products <MATH_0018>\nand hence the axiom of choice. The resulting map does not depend on\nthe choices made, see below.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0019>\nNote that the projection maps furnish a functorial\nmorphism of coverings <MATH_0020>\nand hence, by the construction above, a functorial map of sets\n<MATH_0021>.\nIn other words, there is a transformation of functors\nfrom <MATH_0022>\nto the composition\n<MATH_0023>. Hence by\ngeneralities of colimits we obtain a canonical map\n<MATH_0024>. In terms of the description\nof the set <MATH_0025> above, it just takes the element\nassociated with <MATH_0026> to the\nelement associated with <MATH_0027>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a7f15027f987e58a9f917bf85e16c611e24a0ec4074d6a048cfe61c0fab5405f", "unit_id": "tag:00W1:prose-0002"}
